node_modules/
.next/
# Anchored: the runtime upload/proof/export volume at the repo root only.
# Unanchored, this also swallowed src/lib/storage/.
/storage/
# Fixture workbooks are generated by tests/fixtures/workbook.ts at run time.
# They are build artefacts of the test suite, not committed inputs.
tests/fixtures/generated/
# Real source workbooks. `origin` is a PUBLIC GitHub repo, and these carry live
# customer policy data — 1,171 named applications in the June dashboard alone.
# Nothing in the build reads them; they are reference copies people drop here
# while working. Ignored so a routine `git add .` cannot publish one.
# Deliberate exceptions still work via `git add -f`.
*.xlsb
*.xlsx
*.xls
.env
.env.local
*.log
# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

